80" end="00:10.790">to </span><span begin="00:10.790" end="00:11.850">myself</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.890" end="00:16.730"><span begin="00:13.890" end="00:14.070">You're </span><span begin="00:14.070" end="00:15.460">metaphorical </span><span begin="00:15.460" end="00:15.930">gin </span><span begin="00:15.930" end="00:16.120">and </span><span begin="00:16.120" end="00:16.730">juice</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.130" end="00:20.470"><span begin="00:18.130" end="00:18.350">So </span><span begin="00:18.350" end="00:18.680">come </span><span begin="00:18.680" end="00:18.930">on </span><span begin="00:18.930" end="00:19.210">give </span><span begin="00:19.210" end="00:19.470">me </span><span begin="00:19.470" end="00:19.760">a </span><span begin="00:19.760" end="00:20.470">taste</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.510" end="00:25.270"><span begin="00:22.510" end="00:22.700">Of </span><span begin="00:22.700" end="00:22.890">what </span><span begin="00:22.890" end="00:23.190">it's </span><span begin="00:23.190" end="00:23.510">like </span><span begin="00:23.510" end="00:23.750">to </span><span begin="00:23.750" end="00:24.060">be </span><span begin="00:24.060" end="00:24.480">next </span><span begin="00:24.480" end="00:24.750">to </span><span begin="00:24.750" end="00:25.270">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.900" end="00:29.280"><span begin="00:26.900" end="00:27.070">Won't </span><span begin="00:27.070" end="00:27.270">let </span><span begin="00:27.270" end="00:27.560">one </span><span begin="00:27.560" end="00:27.870">drop </span><span begin="00:27.870" end="00:28.110">go </span><span begin="00:28.110" end="00:28.360">to </span><span begin="00:28.360" end="00:29.280">waste</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.140" end="00:33.889"><span begin="00:31.140" end="00:31.320">You're </span><span begin="00:31.320" end="00:32.670">metaphorical </span><span begin="00:32.670" end="00:32.950">gin </span><span begin="00:32.950" end="00:33.300">and </span><span begin="00:33.300" end="00:33.889">juice</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.339" end="00:40.468"><span begin="00:38.339" end="00:38.519">Cause all </span><span begin="00:38.519" end="00:38.709">of </span><span begin="00:38.709" end="00:38.889">the </span><span begin="00:38.889" end="00:39.078">doubts </span><span begin="00:39.078" end="00:39.278">and </span><span begin="00:39.278" end="00:39.518">the </span><span begin="00:39.518" end="00:40.468">outbursts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.688" end="00:42.677"><span begin="00:40.688" end="00:40.857">Keep </span><span begin="00:40.857" end="00:41.137">making </span><span begin="00:41.137" end="00:41.427">love </span><span begin="00:41.427" end="00:41.617">to </span><span begin="00:41.617" end="00:42.067">each </span><span begin="00:42.067" end="00:42.677">other</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.017" end="00:46.076"><span begin="00:43.017" end="00:43.177">And </span><span begin="00:43.177" end="00:43.437">I'm </span><span begin="00:43.437" end="00:44.417">trying </span><span begin="00:44.417" end="00:44.876">trying </span><span begin="00:44.876" end="00:45.056">I'm </span><span begin="00:45.056" end="00:45.496">trying </span><span begin="00:45.496" end="00:46.076">trying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.866" end="00:48.975"><span begin="00:46.866" end="00:47.146">All </span><span begin="00:47.146" end="00:47.336">of </span><span begin="00:47.336" end="00:47.546">the </span><span begin="00:47.546" end="00:47.906">doubts </span><span begin="00:47.906" end="00:48.065">and </span><span begin="00:48.065" end="00:48.285">the </span><span begin="00:48.285" end="00:48.975">outbursts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.185" end="00:51.203"><span begin="00:49.185" end="00:49.425">Keep </span><span begin="00:49.425" end="00:49.755">making </span><span begin="00:49.755" end="00:50.035">love </span><span begin="00:50.035" end="00:50.184">to </span><span begin="00:50.184" end