</span><span begin="01:35.201" end="01:35.461">love </span><span begin="01:35.461" end="01:35.641">to </span><span begin="01:35.641" end="01:36.191">each </span><span begin="01:36.191" end="01:36.721">other</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.041" end="01:40.080"><span begin="01:37.041" end="01:37.201">And </span><span begin="01:37.201" end="01:37.660">I'm </span><span begin="01:37.660" end="01:38.260">trying </span><span begin="01:38.260" end="01:38.720">trying </span><span begin="01:38.720" end="01:38.900">I'm </span><span begin="01:38.900" end="01:39.450">trying </span><span begin="01:39.450" end="01:40.080">trying</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.860" end="01:42.950"><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:41.150">All </span><span begin="01:41.150" end="01:41.330">of </span><span begin="01:41.330" end="01:41.540">the </span><span begin="01:41.540" end="01:41.840">doubts </span><span begin="01:41.840" end="01:42.030">and </span><span begin="01:42.030" end="01:42.270">the </span><span begin="01:42.270" end="01:42.950">outbursts</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.250" end="01:45.300"><span begin="01:43.250" end="01:43.490">Keep </span><span begin="01:43.490" end="01:43.830">making </span><span begin="01:43.830" end="01:44.050">love </span><span begin="01:44.050" end="01:44.250">to </span><span begin="01:44.250" end="01:44.760">each </span><span begin="01:44.760" end="01:45.300">other</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.550" end="01:48.699"><span begin="01:45.550" end="01:45.900">And </span><span begin="01:45.900" end="01:46.140">I'm </span><span begin="01:46.140" end="01:46.969">trying </span><span begin="01:46.969" end="01:47.429">trying </span><span begin="01:47.429" end="01:47.599">I'm </span><span begin="01:47.599" end="01:48.099">trying </span><span begin="01:48.099" end="01:48.319">but </span><span begin="01:48.319" end="01:48.699">I</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.699" end="01:51.029"><span begin="01:48.699" end="01:49.019">Can't </s